## Quick Start

### 1. Install Required Collections

```bash
ansible-galaxy collection install -r collections/requirements.yml
```

### 2. Configure GCP Service Account

Copy your GCP service account key:

```bash
mkdir -p {{ (aap_gcp_service_account_file | expanduser) | dirname }}
cp /path/to/your/gcp-sa-key.json {{ aap_gcp_service_account_file }}
chmod 600 {{ aap_gcp_service_account_file }}
```

### 3. Test GCP Inventory

```bash
ansible-inventory -i inventories/gcp_dynamic.yml --list
```

### 4. Run Registration Playbook

```bash
# Dry run
ansible-playbook playbooks/gcp_satellite_registration.yml --check

# Actual run
ansible-playbook playbooks/gcp_satellite_registration.yml
```

