## Variables

You can customize the registration by editing `group_vars/all/vars.yml` or passing extra variables:

```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/gcp_satellite_registration.yml \
  -e "serial_execution=10" \
  -e "max_fail_percentage=5"
```

Available variables:
- `serial_execution`: Number of hosts to process in parallel (default: {{ aap_workflow_serial_execution }})
- `max_fail_percentage`: Maximum percentage of failures allowed (default: {{ aap_workflow_max_fail_percentage }})
- `ssh_connection_timeout`: SSH connection timeout in seconds (default: {{ aap_ssh_connection_timeout }})

