## Troubleshooting

### Inventory Not Showing Hosts
```bash
# Refresh inventory cache
rm -f /tmp/gcp_inventory_cache_{{ aap_gcp_project_id }}
ansible-inventory -i inventories/gcp_dynamic.yml --list
```

### SSH Connection Issues
```bash
# Test SSH access
ansible all -i inventories/gcp_dynamic.yml -m ping

# Check GCP OS Login configuration
gcloud compute project-info describe --project={{ aap_gcp_project_id }} \
  --format="value(commonInstanceMetadata.items.filter(key:enable-oslogin))"
```

### Satellite Registration Failures
```bash
# Verify activation key
hammer activation-key list --organization "{{ aap_satellite_organization }}"

# Test Satellite API connectivity
curl -k {{ aap_satellite_url }}/api/v2/ping
```

## Security Notes

- **Vault Password**: Stored in `{{ aap_vault_password_file }}`
- **GCP Service Account Key**: Located at `{{ aap_gcp_service_account_file }}`
- **Never commit** unencrypted credentials to version control
- Rotate GCP service account keys every 90 days
- Use AAP credential injection for production deployments

